<ul><li>Notes plan: 20-video chunks, one markdown file per video</li></ul>
<h2>Chunks</h2>
<ul><li>001–020 — Java Identifiers and Reserved Words … short-circuit,type cast operators</li></ul>
<ul><li>021–040 — Assignment,conditional,new Operators … interfaces-1</li></ul>
<ul><li>041–060 — interfaces-2 … static control flow</li></ul>
<ul><li>061–080 — static block … by Durga Sir</li></ul>
<ul><li>081–100 — Introduction … Introduction</li></ul>
<ul><li>101–120 — regular innerclass … File</li></ul>
<ul><li>121–140 — importent methods … Difference between Array list &amp; linked list</li></ul>
<ul><li>141–160 — limitations of enumerations … HashMap&amp;ConcurrentHashMap</li></ul>
<ul><li>161–180 — Hashtable … The methods for requesting  jvm to run GC</li></ul>
<ul><li>181–200 — finalization-1 … method area</li></ul>
<ul><li>201–203 — stack memory … complete jvm architecture</li></ul>
